            "line": 31,
            "text": "theorem iteratedDeriv_rpow (p : ℝ) (n : ℕ) {t : ℝ} (ht : 0 < t) :\n    iteratedDeriv n (fun t : ℝ => t ^ p) t = rpowCoeff p n * t ^ (p - (n : ℝ))"
